0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "84a7b45c-0623-43e5-a65c-62687da16b47")) (text "HINGE BOARD (lateral hinge enclosure, rides on the Outer Hinge = shin side)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a15fe4db-3c90-4528-925c-b59925a57cdb")) (text "THIGH SIDE (far end of the 8-way harness)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 213.36 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "beea06cd-ca97-489c-8849-061455a8156e")) (text "CALF FSRs (on calf band, via J2)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 154.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3eed5552-7167-40cc-90ba-d0faf3d9b198")) (text "Notes:\n1. I2C bus: AS5600 0x36, shin IMU 0x6B (SA0 high), thigh IMU 0x6A (SA0 low). 2.2k pull-ups on the hinge board only.\n2. FSRs: FSR_EN drives the top of all four dividers, high only while sampling. Out = 3.3 V x 10k / (10k + 1.5k + R_fsr) <= 2.87 V, inside the 0-2.9 V ADC range at 12 dB. All on ADC1. Relative contact indication only, not calibrated pressure.\n3. VBAT_SENSE = VBAT_SW / 2 (220k/220k, ~10 uA). Firmware cutoff 3.5 V.\n4. Thigh IMU INT is not routed (harness kept to 8 conductors); poll it over I2C. D9 spare.\n5. SW1 and F1 (PTC) sit at the cell on the thigh side: the harness is dead when off and current-limited if shorted. Charging over USB-C needs SW1 on. Do not charge while worn.\n6. U2 sits over the hinge-axis magnet (6x2.5 mm diametric, in the Inner Hinge boss), 0.5-3 mm gap." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 186.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "563b3969-9b23-4136-b6d1-0bdf0769b9b4")) (wire (pts (xy 127.0 143.51) (xy 127.0 151.13)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "a068aa5e-e9da-42b0-8dcf-8b9e2b4b995d")) (label "VBAT_SENSE" (at 127 147.32 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "d1e0e7b4-3145-4b6e-b1bd-b679d08fa464")) (symbol (lib_id "Device:Polyfu